      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dacusville%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Dacusville once served as a stagecoach stop along an old Indian Road that ran from Virginia into Georgia territory.",
